      "updated": 1770566501500,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pile :\n\n0\n012\n0E1\n0E1+4\n0E103\n0E10332\n0E103E9   (conflit d6/r1, on choisit de lire, donc d6 car la multiplication est prioritaire)\n\n    Cela change si on a 1+3-5, on r1",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pile :\n\n0\n012\n0E1\n0E1+4\n0E103\n0E10332\n0E103E9   (conflit d6/r1, on choisit de lire, donc d6 car la multiplication est prioritaire)\n\n    Cela change si on a 1+3-5, on r1",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6QlfhySZ5gwg2a6IdgdPM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 529.4575154201254,
      "y": 1217.5223555900375,
      "width": 68.97991943359375,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aj",
